invalid type: string "Note: Flowchart Stage 9 and 10 - Final Invoice and Completion\nType: Application Flowchart\nStage: 9 and 10 of 10\nDescription: How the sale is billed and closed once goods have shipped. A final invoice, also called the commercial or shipped invoice, is generated from the original sales order. When the customer pays the balance, everything closes out.\nFlowchart:\nr item.\nÿÿ